cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or benchmark, please cite it as below."
title: "ExplainGuard-SMB: An Explainable, Auditable, Graph-Aware Fraud-Screening Benchmark and Toolkit for Small Online Businesses"
abstract: >-
  ExplainGuard-SMB is an open benchmark and reference toolkit for real-time
  payment-fraud screening in small U.S. online businesses. It evaluates
  detectors jointly on detection under a fixed alert budget, false alarms at
  equal recall, per-transaction latency, stability of plain-language
  explanations across model re-estimation, and coverage of a tamper-evident
  decision log aligned with the NIST AI Risk Management Framework.
type: software
authors:
